// Owner: real backend platform object first-slice shell boundary.
// Truth: consumes CjguiInternalRendererNoPlatformObjectImplementationReadiness
// and records shell intent, shell policy, teardown proof, failure policy, and
// no-real-backend-platform-object readiness facts.
// Stop-line: no external platform resource, no cross-language surface, no
// graphics work, no state mutation, no runtime state touch, no public surface.
// Same-shape Boundary Brake: this shell is not a platform-ready, backend-ready,
// resource-ready, graphics-work, receipt, record, or publication wrapper.
package cjgui

